      "content": "We're excited to announce the release of Orbit Software v2.4, which includes several improvements and enhancements. \n\nThe new dark mode UI, introduced in commit 882, provides a fresh and modern look for our users. Additionally, commit 885 has streamlined some of our older CSS code, making our application more efficient.\n\nHowever, we've also encountered a few issues that require attention. The login process now experiences a brief delay due to refactoring in commit 883. We're working to resolve this issue as soon as possible.\n\nUnfortunately, we've also identified a critical bug (Bug Report #405) where user passwords are being sent in plain text over some connections. This is a serious security vulnerability and we're taking immediate action to address it.\n\nIn the meantime, users may experience issues when uploading large PNGs, as reported in Bug Report #402. We're actively working on a fix for this issue.\n\nFinally, commit 889 has updated our help documentation to better reflect the new features and functionality in v2.4.\n\nWe appreciate your patience and understanding as we continue to improve and refine our application.",
